Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 22:07:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] DSi/DSiWare for Nebulos: file: BIOS dirs, local TMD,
 auto-import (RECONSTRUCTED)

- SharedPreferencesSettingsRepository.getTreeDocument + FileSystemConfigurationDirectoryVerifier accept file: URIs
  (nebulos/RomUris treeDocumentFor -> DocumentFile.fromFile) so bios_dir / dsi_bios_dir given as file URIs work
- NusDSiWareMetadataRepository (downloaded the DSi TMD from Nintendo NUS; Nebulos has no network) removed;
  LocalDSiWareMetadataRepository reads <externalFilesDir>/watermelonds/dsiware/tmd/<category8><title8>.tmd (520 bytes,
  written by Nebulos DsiSupport.kt DsiWareCia.writeDsiTmd); MelonModule provides it
- EmulatorLaunchPreconditionChecker: when NebulosBridge.active a DSiWare title missing from the DSi NAND is imported
  automatically (log tag NebulosDsi) instead of failing with "title not installed"

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
